+7      EFa ← d̂a + max{EFb : b ∈ P(a)}
+8  T ← max({0} ∪ {EFa : a ∈ Vt})
+9  for a in reverse π:
+10     LFa ← min{LFb − d̂b : b ∈ S(a)}
+11 for r ∈ Rt:
